	)
	(text "RX_VU - how this sheet works (REV08_PLAN section 5; RX_VU_SPEC)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 529.59 485.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "8a62c52a-5257-51b9-bebc-400e4b8034c0")
	)
	(text "1. J961 -> ESD -> bias tee (U1314, JP1301: 5 V as built, 3.3 V by the jumper) -> LNA U1301 or its bypass (U1302/U1303)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 529.59 488.95 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "f10c7f81-47ad-565e-ae7a-0f32f686f2f8")
	)
	(text "2. Preselector A (U1304/U1305, V2V1): 00 straight, 01 FM band-pass, 10 FM reject, 11 preselector B."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 529.59 494.03 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "b65a8d70-7979-5df4-be9c-d005196196a7")
	)
	(text "3. Preselector B (U1306/U1307, V1V2V3): 000 UHF low-pass 480 MHz, 001 SAW 1090 MHz, 010 HPF 1 GHz, 011 LPF 1 GHz, 1xx spare."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 529.59 497.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "6afc43a7-e308-5b8d-b244-2e7ad0d0838b")
	)
	(text "4. Converter bypass (U1308/U1309): CTRL high = through the RFFC5072 (LO 85-4200 MHz, IF 135 MHz), low = direct 30-170 MHz."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 529.59 502.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "5b9a4819-4e8e-512d-be33-8ec5587daad5")
	)
	(text "5. Anti-alias 170 MHz, IF amplifier U1310, attenuator U1311 (0-31.5 dB, powers up at 31.5 dB) -> IF_VU -> SW2 (ROUTING, C927)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 529.59 506.73 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "315221ff-afbc-5647-bc09-53ce31e20edc")
	)
	(text "6. Control: U1313 TCA6416A at 0x20 on XO_SCL/XO_SDA. P00-P01 PSA_V1-V2, P02-P04 PSB_V1-V3, P05 LNA_ON, P06 CONV_ON,"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 529.59 511.81 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "c553c55b-9a84-5171-85fb-c702c60745d6")
	)
	(text "   P07 BIAS_EN_N, P10 BIAS_FLT_N (in), P11 ENX, P12 SCLK, P13 SDATA (RFFC5072 and, through R1330, PE4312), P14 LD (in),"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 529.59 515.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "8a233e14-e79d-5477-8a28-28ef9a11e95e")
	)
	(text "   P15 RESETX, P16 ATT_LE, P17 ENBL. Pull resistors keep the bias off, the converter off and deselected until it is written."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 529.59 520.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "83f06054-ac6e-57f6-868b-784225f3734c")
	)
	(text "7. +3V0_RF: U1315 LP5907-3.0 from +3V3_D through FB1301, 180 mA budgeted of 250. The mixer's current flows through T1302's"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 529.59 524.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e5294c7f-0cb1-5415-a24a-ce181ff0c208")
	)
	(text "   centre tap: program MIX2_IDD <= 3 (TC4-1W+ rated 30 mA DC)."
